        "round_trips_per_minute_one_submit_native_bracket_exit": 1000
      }
    ],
    "conclusions": [
      "At 200 calls/min the ceiling is 200 order actions/min: at most 100 submit+cancel pairs, or 100 two-submit round trips.",
      "At 1000 calls/min the ceiling is 1000 order actions/min: at most 500 submit+cancel pairs, or 500 two-submit round trips.",
      "1000 round trips/min needs at least 2000 calls/min with two submits per round trip, and more than 1000 calls/min even with a native exit leg once any cancel, read or retry is included; 1000 calls/min cannot carry it.",
      "The harness acceptance target counts order actions (submits + cancels), so 170 actions/min at a 200 limit is about 85 submits/min; 170 submits/min with individual cancels would need about 340 calls/min.",
      "Illustrative cost at the quoted non-retail rate (live accounts only; paper has no commission): 1000 one-share round trips/min = 2000 shares/min x $0.004 = $8.00/min."
    ]
